{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23638","headline":"忆洛中所居 · 白居易","name":"忆洛中所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽忆东都宅，春来事宛然。\n雪销行径里，水上卧房前。\n厌绿栽黄竹，嫌红种白莲。\n醉教鸎送酒，闲遣鹤看船。\n幸是林园主，慙爲食禄牵。\n宦情薄似纸，乡思急於弦。\n岂合姑苏守，归休更待年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}